{"team":"SEA","col":"#69BE28","identity":"balanced","funnel":"balanced-D","plays_pg":59.5,"adot":7.5,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>No Fixed Address</h2><p>There's no bell-cow to bank on \u2014 the lead back sees just <strong>50%</strong> of carries (league ~59%), a committee that caps any one back's ceiling and makes their rushing props matchup- and script-dependent.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>In the passing game the ball funnels to <strong>Jaxon Smith-Njigba</strong> \u2014 <strong>29% of targets</strong> (league ~23%), a genuine alpha share that concentrates the receiving value at the top.</p><p>The WR2 is unusually involved here \u2014 <strong>18%</strong> of targets (league ~15%), meaning there's bankable volume beyond the top receiver.</p><p>They're a heavy under-center team (61% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 59% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Their red-zone identity is <strong>run-first</strong> (47% pass), funnelling touchdown equity to <strong>Jadarian Price</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 No Obvious Seam</h2><p>They lock down opposing WR1s \u2014 just 48 rec yds/game (vs ~58); fade receiving props there.</p><p><strong>Soft against opposing tight ends</strong> \u2014 42 rec yds/game (vs ~35). A rec-yards target.</p><p>They surrender <strong>106 rushing</strong> and <strong>226 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). No dominant funnel \u2014 read it matchup by matchup.</p><p>A stingy, efficient defense \u2014 just 42% success allowed (vs ~44%); temper expectations for opposing skill players.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs).</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Sam Darnold","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":11,"props":{"Comp":19.29,"Att":30.13,"Pass Yds":227.79,"Pass TD":1.43,"INT":0.67,"Rush Yds":10.27}}],"RB":[{"name":"Jadarian Price","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":26,"props":{"Rush Att":12.16,"Rush Yds":51.3,"Tgt":2.31,"Rec":1.8,"Rec Yds":12.72}},{"name":"George Holani","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":13,"props":{"Rush Att":3.15,"Rush Yds":11.69,"Tgt":1.88,"Rec":1.3,"Rec Yds":9.18}},{"name":"Emanuel Wilson","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":20,"props":{"Rush Att":5.43,"Rush Yds":23.94,"Tgt":1.8,"Rec":1.23,"Rec Yds":8.15}},{"name":"Velus Jones Jr.","slot":"RB4","starter":false,"td":14,"props":{"Rush Att":3.24,"Rush Yds":18.45,"Tgt":1.24,"Rec":0.74,"Rec Yds":6.33}}],"WR":[{"name":"Jaxon Smith-Njigba","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":31,"props":{"Tgt":8.34,"Rec":5.98,"Rec Yds":74.66,"Rec TD":0.38}},{"name":"Rashid Shaheed","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":12,"props":{"Tgt":3.13,"Rec":2.0,"Rec Yds":28.75,"Rec TD":0.12}},{"name":"Cooper Kupp","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":29,"props":{"Tgt":6.19,"Rec":4.4,"Rec Yds":53.0,"Rec TD":0.35}},{"name":"Tory Horton","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":22,"props":{"Tgt":3.03,"Rec":1.64,"Rec Yds":20.27,"Rec TD":0.25}}],"TE":[{"name":"AJ Barner","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":22,"props":{"Tgt":3.49,"Rec":2.71,"Rec Yds":26.02,"Rec TD":0.25}},{"name":"Eric Saubert","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":13,"props":{"Tgt":3.06,"Rec":1.82,"Rec Yds":15.1,"Rec TD":0.14}},{"name":"Elijah Arroyo","slot":"TE3","starter":false,"td":10,"props":{"Tgt":2.36,"Rec":1.35,"Rec Yds":14.67,"Rec TD":0.1}}]},"schedule":[{"week":1,"ha":"vs","opp":"NE","opp_col":"#7FA8C9","gid":"2026_01_NE_SEA","spread":"\u22123.5","proj":"24\u201320","win":true},{"week":2,"ha":"@","opp":"ARI","opp_col":"#E64868","gid":"2026_02_SEA_ARI","spread":"\u221210.0","proj":"27\u201317","win":true},{"week":3,"ha":"@","opp":"WAS","opp_col":"#F2C15A","gid":"2026_03_SEA_WAS","spread":"\u2